WEBVTT

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:14.630
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.870
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:22.210
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.310
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.250
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.600
Has your fatigue about reached its peak?

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:40.170
I'll talk to the Warrior Chief, so you rest tonight...!

00:00:40.980 --> 00:00:43.240
l'm okay... l'm just getting started.

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:46.540
Answering while talking in your sleep has absolutely zero power of persuasion. Rest!

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:51.210
But...we don't know who might be put in danger or when.

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:54.550
l don't need rest. lnstead, l should do more special training.

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.950
Right now, l just want to get as strong as l possibly can...

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:05.460
Hello, Warrior Chief? lt's Tokiko.

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:09.160
l'd like to give Kazuki a break from training tonight.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:13.900
Yeah. lt's raining today too, so...
Okay, no training tonight.

00:01:14.610 --> 00:01:16.640
<i>No training if it rains...</i>

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:18.350
<i>Kamehameha the Great.</i>

00:01:19.110 --> 00:01:20.710
Do you have an umbrella, Tokiko?

00:01:21.150 --> 00:01:22.520
No. You?

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:25.450
Nope. What should we do?
Should we run?

00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:27.820
Here, I'll loan you this.

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:36.890
<i>The Hayasaka Twins</i>

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:41.360
You shouldn't let a girl get wet in the rain!

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:47.040
I'll wait for my little brother's club activities to end and go home with him, so...

00:01:48.340 --> 00:01:49.140
Who's that?

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:50.440
Umm, as l recall...

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.580
Class 3-A, Ouka Hayasaka!
Student council...president!

00:01:55.620 --> 00:01:58.710
Kazuki, here l thought you were dedicated to Tokiko

00:01:58.790 --> 00:02:01.660
and so, l was secretly celebrating my friend's happiness!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.450
You betrayed me.

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.490
Things will get complicated, so you shut up!

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:07.920
And then you toyed with her!

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:08.860
Shut up, pervert!

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:17.200
What, all you guys have umbrellas?
Then l should return this one.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.540
Does anyone know the student council president's little brother's club activity?

00:02:20.610 --> 00:02:23.170
Are you kidding us?
He's quite famous around here.

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.650
Awesome!

00:02:25.710 --> 00:02:26.740
He's the ace of the Kendo team

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:28.910
and he finished in the top four in the individual nationals last year.

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:34.560
Thank you for the umbrella.

00:02:34.790 --> 00:02:37.730
l met up with my friends, so l thought l'd return it as soon as possible...

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:40.290
Your little brother's good...

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:42.860
But he's been kind of struggling lately.

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.300
You okay?

00:02:48.800 --> 00:02:49.600
Get the first-aid kit!

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:52.640
Excuse me, next please.

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:58.580
Haven't you had enough, Hayasaka?

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.840
You'll be able to win the next tournament with your skill, l tell you.

00:03:03.050 --> 00:03:06.040
No... Winning in a tournament is of secondary importance.

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.920
Right now, l just want... to get as strong as l possibly can.

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:13.060
But you know,

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:16.220
the other team members will get crushed if you do any more than this.

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:17.520
I'll go easy on them, so...

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:18.700
I'll do it!

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:21.160
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:03:21.240 --> 00:03:22.800
You're wiped out and fatigued...

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.970
l'm okay. l won't be doing any training tonight.

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:27.140
And besides, l've kind of cheered up a little

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:30.140
having found someone who feels the same as l do.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.950
Come on.
Someone who's not on the team...

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:35.310
No, please.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:38.350
lt doesn't look like any of the team members will take me on.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.050
And besides...

00:03:43.630 --> 00:03:44.560
He's pretty good!

00:03:44.630 --> 00:03:46.930
And although Hayasaka Senpai is going easy on him...

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.620
He still hasn't scored one hit on him.

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:51.930
<i>ln addition to making it</i> <i>through several actual battles,</i>

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.970
<i>he's been receiving the Warrior Chief's</i> <i>training for a whole week.</i>

00:03:55.270 --> 00:03:56.570
<i>Of course he can at least</i> <i>do this well!</i>

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.300
Whoops.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:03.230
You're inexperienced in Kendo just as l thought.

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:06.810
But you more than make up for that with your rousing movement.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:08.270
What?!

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.980
lt's needless to go easy on you if you're the opponent.

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:16.110
There it is, Hayasaka's favorite...

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:16.780
Reverse-dou!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:18.590
As for the Reverse-dou,

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:21.130
this is a spot where a samurai's large and small double swords get in the way

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.130
and would not easily turn into a fatal wound even if cut.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.200
And in present-day Kendo, the hardest thing is to judge

00:04:25.270 --> 00:04:27.290
whether the hit should be scored for the above reason.

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.170
Really, what <i>are</i> you?!

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.760
For that matter, how many seconds is this exchange?!

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:39.110
You okay?!

00:04:39.350 --> 00:04:41.910
More or less. But wow, l never thought it'd be like this even though

00:04:41.980 --> 00:04:44.920
l blocked with a bamboo sword and was wearing body armor...

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.850
We were told before by a real swordsman

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:50.360
that if my little brother were to use his reverse-dou with a real sword,

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.520
it would cut through a body, double swords and all, right in half.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:59.760
lt's the first time someone's been able to block a hit like that with a bamboo sword.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:02.970
Thanks to you, it made for some good training. Thanks!

00:05:03.270 --> 00:05:04.530
lt's the same face!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.770
They're twins!

00:05:05.970 --> 00:05:09.430
Yes. But since we're fraternal twins, we don't look exactly alike...

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.510
l want to ask one thing...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:15.180
Why in the world did you offer to be my training opponent?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.150
l had just been thinking the same as you were;

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:21.310
l wanted to get as strong as l possibly could now, so.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.790
Why's that?

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:26.060
lt's a secret. lt's not something l can tell people.

00:05:26.460 --> 00:05:26.950
What about you?

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:31.190
Then it'll be a secret for me as well...

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:32.960
l'm Shusui Hayasaka.

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.890
l wonder if you'd join me again for training if you'd like.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:37.530
l'm Kazuki Muto.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:41.110
Sure. l won't be able to everyday, but feel free to ask.

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.450
Password!

00:05:50.690 --> 00:05:51.480
ln one hand...

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:52.320
A pistol.

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:53.220
ln one's heart...

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:53.950
A bouquet of flowers.

00:05:54.560 --> 00:05:55.350
On one's lips...

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:56.760
Liquor of fire.

00:05:57.230 --> 00:05:58.120
On one's back...

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.450
Life.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:02.430
What is it you want to ask me?

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.200
lt's been a week since
Jinnai disappeared.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.770
Undoubtedly, an alchemist warrior has taken care of him.

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.800
We still haven't been able to learn of the group's background

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:16.240
and all we know is that the warrior is a student in the same school as you.

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:20.840
You obviously know.
Who is the alchemist warrior?!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:26.050
l've no intention of answering.
He's the man <i>I'll</i> defeat.

00:06:28.390 --> 00:06:31.380
Well, that's an answer l anticipated.

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:34.020
As planned, I'll give <i>them</i> their turn.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.690
Password...

00:06:35.960 --> 00:06:36.830
ln one hand...

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.260
—A pistol!
—A pistol!

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:44.070
Find the alchemist warrior hiding in Ginsei Academy and eliminate him.

00:06:45.140 --> 00:06:48.540
But do it quietly and behind closed doors.

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:52.440
That place is the venue for the special banquet celebrating his resurrection.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:56.020
l'd like to avoid causing any needless uproar now.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.320
I'll leave the kakugane with you during the mission.

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:02.010
lf you succeed, I'll give them to you.

00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:04.190
Also...

00:07:04.460 --> 00:07:06.430
I'll grant your wish.

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:10.060
lt's the chance you've been waiting for.
Good luck.

00:07:11.330 --> 00:07:12.230
Wish?

00:07:12.470 --> 00:07:14.440
lt's something you don't need to know about.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.540
Being told that makes me totally curious.

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:21.570
Perfect. I'll give you a mission as well.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:25.910
Observe those two and inform me if there's any suspicious activity.

00:07:26.510 --> 00:07:27.910
I'll be a watcher, huh?

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:30.480
You also sent the other two to keep an eye on me, though.

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:36.690
Nothing personal. l just want to take all possible measures for "his" sake.

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:42.090
Nihao! Buddy-buddy siblings!

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.220
We heard.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:45.990
lt seems you've been left with the disposal of the alchemist warrior?

00:07:46.430 --> 00:07:49.730
<i>Tai and Shii. The most giant pair</i> <i>in all of the LXE.</i>

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:54.510
l can't accept that.
Here l thought we'd be on next.

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:56.540
Why does he ask you guys who're lowest in rank?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:59.240
We're students at the academy,

00:07:59.310 --> 00:08:01.370
so l think we're best suited for this mission...

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.910
Don't kid me.
Even if you're suited for it,

00:08:03.990 --> 00:08:07.250
it'd be awful if you were to lose in battle and kakugane were to decrease.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:09.950
You guys just carry out your search for the warrior!

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:13.650
We'll take over the battle, so hand over the kakugane...

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:23.160
Don't get in our way!
And keep your hands off my sister!

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:24.260
Shusui!

00:08:25.840 --> 00:08:28.070
Wow! lt's stuck on the wall!

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:28.940
Shut up!

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:32.840
l'm sorry!
I'll lecture my little brother later.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:37.350
And as for the mission, we don't have the authority to make changes.

00:08:37.420 --> 00:08:39.850
So please speak directly with Dr. Butterfly.

00:08:40.090 --> 00:08:42.220
Darn it... lf only we had kakugane.

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:45.890
Then shall we waste those siblings and take the kakugane?

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.420
You're right.

00:08:47.700 --> 00:08:51.930
And then if we carry out the mission,
Dr. Butterfly will probably accept it.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:55.870
But that little brother's quite troublesome.

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:58.630
He's steadily boosting his strength despite being at the low rank as he is.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.940
No sweat!

00:09:01.010 --> 00:09:04.540
lf we can just snuff out the older sister and take away the kakugane...!

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:11.780
There's absolutely no chance of Dr. Butterfly including those two on the mission.

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:14.820
Even their appearance is monstrous.

00:09:14.890 --> 00:09:17.120
lf they were even to approach the school like that,

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:18.920
it'd be an incident for the police.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:22.090
Don't worry. This mission is ours.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:25.120
Find the alchemist warrior and exterminate him.

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:26.730
lf we do that, our wish...

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.600
Will come true.

00:09:41.980 --> 00:09:43.380
Big Brother's fired up!

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:44.380
Wow!

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:47.350
But, this isn't Kendo training anymore!

00:09:55.560 --> 00:09:56.660
There it is!
The reverse-dou!

00:09:56.830 --> 00:09:57.660
And moreover, a one-handed strike.

00:09:57.970 --> 00:09:59.090
You okay, Kazuki?

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:01.530
Okay, friends!

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:02.700
Yeah.

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:05.570
Heh... You've gotten better, Shusui!

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:08.780
No more regrets.

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:10.510
He's burned up.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:11.970
Wow.

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:13.610
Hayasaka Senpai!

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.910
Women are cruel!

00:10:16.150 --> 00:10:20.050
Actually, that's one of the reasons why nobody likes to be Shusui's opponent.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:22.160
No matter who does it, they end up being the stooge.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:24.590
Jeez. Big Brother's an amateur.

00:10:24.760 --> 00:10:26.630
You could at least go a little easy on him.

00:10:27.900 --> 00:10:29.830
l'm sorry. l let myself get carried away.

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:34.330
The little sister by blood is the cruelest of all.

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.170
Muto's really doing a good job.

00:10:37.270 --> 00:10:38.930
To the extent l want him as a team member.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:40.840
You okay, Muto?

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:43.940
Yeah, l'm okay.
But l'm a little frustrated!

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:45.540
Even though a whole week's passed,

00:10:45.610 --> 00:10:47.450
l can't deflect the reverse-dou no matter what l do.

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:51.650
No, you're definitely getting stronger.
And of course l am, too...

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:54.780
lt seems we're well matched.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:11:00.130
<i>Basic training as an alchemist warrior,</i>

00:11:00.190 --> 00:11:03.720
<i>the training here with</i> <i>a touch of mock battle rather than Kendo...</i>

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:05.100
<i>And...</i>

00:11:05.400 --> 00:11:08.600
<i>Right now l just want to get</i> <i>as strong as l possibly can!</i>

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:11.770
Results made possible thanks to his strong feelings, huh?

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.600
<i>Faculty Room</i>
Okay, please lock up and turn off the lights.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:19.610
Sure. Same as always.

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:24.780
<i>lf the appearance of the alchemist warrior</i> <i>in this town to start with</i>

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:28.980
<i>was due to getting wind</i> <i>of Koshaku Chono's plans,</i>

00:11:29.060 --> 00:11:30.890
<i>then we should consider it</i> <i>a high possibility that</i>

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:34.360
<i>it's a person who became associated</i> <i>with the school after the start of this year.</i>

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:37.290
<i>First, there are the</i> <i>newly appointed teachers,</i>

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:39.330
<i>new students and...</i>

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.270
<i>Tokiko Tsumura</i>
<i>TRANSFER</i>
<i>transfer students.</i>

00:11:44.810 --> 00:11:47.000
Oh, everyone going home?

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:48.670
You too, Ouka Senpai?

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:51.610
Yes. l was pressed with some student council work and it took a while.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:53.150
Then shall we go home together?

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.280
Oh, but we worked out quite a bit today,

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:58.080
so we were all thinking of stopping by the public bath now.

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:01.120
l see. Then...

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.820
Maybe I'll go with you guys...

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.120
78! 55! 79!

00:12:09.800 --> 00:12:11.990
My Mahiro eye's pretty awesome, huh?!

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:14.030
Wh-What?!

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.230
You don't have to be embarrassed.
We're fellow girls, so...

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.200
That's not the issue!

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:24.740
Let's see, Ouka Senpai's 88!

00:12:24.910 --> 00:12:28.820
Say, you two are in the dorm, right?
What about your families?

00:12:29.080 --> 00:12:33.650
Hmm, both my mom and dad are working abroad, so...

00:12:34.790 --> 00:12:36.120
What about your family, Tsumura?

00:12:36.660 --> 00:12:39.150
l don't have one.
They passed away ages ago.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:40.920
Oh my, l'm sorry.

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:41.960
lt's okay.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.060
On the contrary, l get tired when people worry about me.

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:46.360
What about your family, Ouka Senpai?

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:50.600
lt's a secret.
But now, l live together with Shusui.

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:54.100
l see. That's why you siblings get along so well.

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:57.870
My, but you guys also get along very well, don't you?

00:12:58.310 --> 00:13:01.340
But aren't you, in actuality, just a wee bit jealous

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:04.180
that your big brother's got a girlfriend like Tsumura?

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:07.480
Hmm, if Tokiko became my older sister...

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:08.620
Oh, l see.

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:10.920
At the end of the day, you keep all the good stuff for yourself, huh?

00:13:10.990 --> 00:13:13.020
Kazuki and l aren't on terms like that!

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:20.390
What? Then Big Brother isn't getting in shape to protect you?

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:21.470
l was totally convinced

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:23.940
that was the case since it's gotten dangerous around here lately...

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.700
But that's what Shusui Senpai is doing, right?

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:30.630
Right. After all, it's just...

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.510
us two siblings...

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:36.420
Listen up.
Having top grades in the class,

00:13:36.480 --> 00:13:39.580
being athletic and having good looks isn't possible.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.450
Even if you say it isn't possible...

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.790
He must have some kind of secret that he absolutely can't tell people about!

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:45.890
For example?

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.260
For example...

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.030
Bigger than Okakura, smaller than Kazuki.

00:13:52.900 --> 00:13:54.770
Bigger than Kazuki, smaller than Daihama.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.360
Bigger than Okakura, smaller than Rokumasu.

00:13:58.570 --> 00:14:01.060
Bigger than Rokumasu, smaller than Kazuki.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.950
—B-Beautiful!
—B-Beautiful!

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:12.950
Absolutely flawless...

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:15.260
lt's the ultimate...

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:17.120
The ultimate good-looking guy.

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.060
Now if he'd just put on the same mask as this,

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:21.860
he'd be the totally ultimate.

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:27.560
lt's a breach of manners to make a racket in a public bath.

00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:32.770
Hi-ya... lt seems you've been getting strong lately.

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:36.540
And it seems... you've finally obtained kakugane.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:38.700
You could say that.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:43.710
But as you see, and as one would expect, l haven't brought it with me into the bath,

00:14:43.780 --> 00:14:45.480
but do you want to go at it knowing that?!

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.620
That wouldn't be fair.

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.920
We're supposed to fight after we're thoroughly prepared, right?

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:53.430
A hypocrite as always, huh?

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:56.990
Say whatever you want.
I'll go on like this all the while!

00:14:57.500 --> 00:15:00.940
Now <i>that'</i>s the Kazuki Muto l must defeat.

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:08.910
Be careful.
The hand of the enemy's getting close.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.810
Wha--?!

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:26.280
<i>A watcher.</i> <i>l knew we were being followed.</i>

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:29.060
Attendant, one fruit-flavored milk, please!

00:15:31.770 --> 00:15:33.760
That's the butterfly mask phantom.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.670
So he really does exist. l thought it was just a rumor...

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:38.960
Kazuki, what were you guys talking about...?

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:40.400
Talking about?!

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:43.170
A little about security in this town.

00:15:43.380 --> 00:15:44.440
Liar!

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:48.680
l see. Papillon is a watcher.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.510
lf he's a hindrance, shall l wipe him out?

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:53.510
Hey-hey.
Don't be saying such vicious things.

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:56.520
But if we've got a watcher on us,

00:15:56.590 --> 00:15:59.490
the slightest mistake could be used as an opportunity for our dismissal,

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.890
so we need to be more cautious.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:03.390
l see.

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.430
<i>Manager</i>
Papillon gave you such a warning!

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.430
Can we trust him?

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:11.730
Probably. He maintains a peculiar trust towards Kazuki.

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:14.570
For the time being, be more alert than you've been until now!

00:16:15.210 --> 00:16:18.700
Understood. I'll patrol the inside of the school building

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.840
and if l find an enemy,
I'll kill them immediately.

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:26.010
l want to interrogate them about the LXE, so l'd prefer that you take them alive.

00:16:26.690 --> 00:16:28.850
But more importantly, your highest priority should be...

00:16:29.490 --> 00:16:30.720
To not produce victims.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.590
Bravo. Exactly!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.230
Here, huh?!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:39.300
Okay, let's go!

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:43.770
These disguises are perfect!

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.700
We won't arouse suspicion.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.530
That's suspicious!

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:50.110
Totally suspicious!

00:16:50.710 --> 00:16:52.180
<i>Kendo Club</i>
A totally suspicious pair?!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:55.140
lt's well worth seeing!
Check it out, guys.

00:16:55.520 --> 00:16:56.450
<i>—Could it be?!</i>
<i>—Could it be?!</i>

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:57.690
<i>Tai and Shii?!</i>

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.150
<i>The enemy Chono spoke of!</i>

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.880
What is it? The school's all in an uproar.

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:06.060
My, this is a first.
You're not with Muto today.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:09.430
l'm telling you, Kazuki and l are not on such terms.

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:13.430
But your timing is perfect. l'd wanted to talk with you a little more.

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:20.440
l found it!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:22.670
The kakugane and your life are ours!

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:28.780
<i>Homunculi! l never thought</i> <i>they'd openly attack like this!</i>

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:29.880
Hold it!

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:32.590
<i>The little Hayasaka brother's appeared!</i>

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:33.380
<i>But...</i>

00:17:33.720 --> 00:17:34.690
<i>Who's that kid?!</i>

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.120
<i>The mission must be</i> <i>behind closed doors!</i>

00:17:37.290 --> 00:17:40.160
<i>Darn it. The slightest mistake will be used</i> <i>as an opportunity for our dismissal!</i>

00:17:40.590 --> 00:17:41.290
Darn it.

00:17:41.630 --> 00:17:43.690
<i>We must not involve the civilians here...</i>

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.320
<i>No good.</i>
<i>We can't use Buso Renkin!</i>

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:48.230
Buso Renkin!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.600
Run, Ouka Senpai!

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:54.830
Sunlight Flasher!

00:17:56.310 --> 00:17:57.280
Blinding?!

00:17:58.450 --> 00:18:00.210
Bring it. Over here, homunculi!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:02.720
Shusui Senpai!
Stay beside Ouka Sensei!

00:18:02.980 --> 00:18:04.320
You're in the way. Move it!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:08.350
Tai! Change targets!

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:11.020
l know!
An alchemist warrior has appeared!

00:18:11.190 --> 00:18:12.990
We have no use for those siblings now!

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:14.620
As l recall, according to Jinnai's report,

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.490
the one using the spear is still half a warrior!

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:17.890
We can manage!

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.130
Fire?

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:23.400
ls it a prank?!

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:27.700
<i>Now we can clear people out of the school</i> <i>until the security company gets here!</i>

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:29.140
<i>During that time...</i>

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:31.970
I'll explain later. You guys stay there!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:35.410
l knew it.
She's also an alchemist warrior.

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.480
—Kakugane, kakugane!
—Kakugane, kakugane!

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:41.290
Kazuki! Hey!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.590
Don't be using Buso Renkin as you please!

00:18:43.990 --> 00:18:44.890
Sorry! l couldn't help it!

00:18:45.330 --> 00:18:46.950
You think, "l couldn't help it," settles this?!

00:18:47.030 --> 00:18:48.520
What about Ouka Senpai and Shusui Senpai?

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:49.320
Are they hurt?

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:50.660
They're okay!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.220
They're not even in any real shock or anything.

00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:53.290
Very much normal!

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:55.060
<i>Very much normal!?</i>

00:18:55.470 --> 00:18:57.500
<i>Attacked by two super humans</i>

00:18:57.570 --> 00:18:59.300
<i>and witnessing the Buso Renkin</i> <i>with their own eyes?</i>

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:01.500
Kazuki, behind you!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.380
First, I'll be taking your life!

00:19:12.150 --> 00:19:13.750
<i>This homunculus is strong!</i>

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:16.720
<i>But l'm also a little stronger than before!</i>

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.060
Move it, Shii!

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.500
lt annoys me watching a battle with your number of moves!

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:25.970
Crushing with one blow.
This is the best.

00:19:30.070 --> 00:19:31.560
<i>His battle form is changing.</i>

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:34.700
<i>What were once mainly charge attacks</i>

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:37.750
<i>is now skillful lance control in response</i> <i>to the enemy's movement!</i>

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:40.700
<i>His experience in actual battle until now,</i>

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.340
<i>in addition to his special training</i> <i>with the Warrior Chief,</i>

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:46.050
<i>and training with Shusui Hayasaka,</i> <i>and the will to become stronger.</i>

00:19:46.590 --> 00:19:49.820
<i>Four powers are starting to become one.</i>

00:19:50.220 --> 00:19:52.160
Don't be getting carried away, boy!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:54.620
—What?!
—What?!

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:56.360
This wound...

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:57.920
Could it have been there already from that time?!

00:20:00.000 --> 00:20:01.830
Uh, uh-oh. lt's a complete disaster!

00:20:02.100 --> 00:20:03.400
l won't let you get away!

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:12.140
Tokiko!

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:16.620
<i>That just now was an attack</i> <i>made by a Buso Renkin.</i>

00:20:17.050 --> 00:20:18.350
<i>And Kazuki's opponent also...</i>

00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:24.820
Two different types of Buso Renkin. lt seems the real enemy is a different two!

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:26.520
l messed up.

00:20:27.190 --> 00:20:30.360
lt's okay.
We've been shown their Buso Renkin.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.790
Neither of them is a match for me!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.770
The Hayasaka siblings are the enemy... LXE...

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:38.900
Homunculi!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.070
Abnormal speed and sharpness...

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:49.930
Add to that Kazuki's energy attacks has no effect?!

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:53.400
Shusui Hayasaka...
What's with his Buso Renkin?

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:56.510
Next time, "lt Seems We're Well Matched"

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.450
I'll splatter your guts out!
